        <title>PUYA ADC — 单通道转换（内部温度传感器）（LL 库）</title>
        <link>https://clingyang.github.io/p/puya-adc-%E5%8D%95%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E6%B8%A9%E5%BA%A6%E4%BC%A0%E6%84%9F%E5%99%A8ll-%E5%BA%93/</link>
